{
  "bvid": "BV14M411B7dk",
  "page": 1,
  "source": "subtitle-ai",
  "language": "ai-zh",
  "model": null,
  "content_sha256": "19bb33419ca21b5b9f44c2c236e7dc9bb9187e3dbbbdc11ebf35ed37c40bf9b1",
  "segments": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "start_ms": 0,
      "end_ms": 4380,
      "text": "我我真的是我真的是有点就是说你们这些小孩"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "start_ms": 4380,
      "end_ms": 5460,
      "text": "我我再强调一遍"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "start_ms": 5460,
      "end_ms": 7860,
      "text": "你们这些小孩能不能头脑清醒一点"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "start_ms": 7860,
      "end_ms": 11520,
      "text": "想一想懂不懂马克思这件事情"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "start_ms": 11520,
      "end_ms": 14300,
      "text": "如果懂不懂马克思的标准"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "start_ms": 17460,
      "end_ms": 23940,
      "text": "被拿来被用来授予行动的合法性"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "start_ms": 26340,
      "end_ms": 27740,
      "text": "你们这些小孩儿"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "start_ms": 27740,
      "end_ms": 32000,
      "text": "那谁可以用来去判定别人懂不懂马克思"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "start_ms": 32240,
      "end_ms": 33320,
      "text": "就这群人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "start_ms": 33320,
      "end_ms": 33920,
      "text": "就这群人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "start_ms": 33920,
      "end_ms": 34580,
      "text": "就这些老人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "start_ms": 34580,
      "end_ms": 35480,
      "text": "还他徒子徒孙"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "start_ms": 35480,
      "end_ms": 38240,
      "text": "他们有资格去判定谁懂马克思"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "start_ms": 38240,
      "end_ms": 39320,
      "text": "谁不懂马克思"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "start_ms": 39320,
      "end_ms": 40520,
      "text": "谁可以批评马克思"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "start_ms": 40520,
      "end_ms": 41739,
      "text": "谁不可以批马克思"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "start_ms": 41840,
      "end_ms": 45080,
      "text": "谁可以用其他视角去分析判断马克思"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "start_ms": 45080,
      "end_ms": 46340,
      "text": "所以不能用其他视角"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "start_ms": 46340,
      "end_ms": 47060,
      "text": "学术"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "start_ms": 47060,
      "end_ms": 50000,
      "text": "也就是学术上要超于马克思"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "start_ms": 50060,
      "end_ms": 52580,
      "text": "我们都没说学术上超越马克思"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "start_ms": 52580,
      "end_ms": 55019,
      "text": "我们说学术上成为马克思"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "start_ms": 57160,
      "end_ms": 59460,
      "text": "还有还有那个可笑至极"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "start_ms": 59460,
      "end_ms": 61020,
      "text": "我最后说的有一个可笑至极的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "start_ms": 61020,
      "end_ms": 61920,
      "text": "这群人的理论"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "start_ms": 61920,
      "end_ms": 63960,
      "text": "真的是可笑至极的理论"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "start_ms": 63960,
      "end_ms": 65400,
      "text": "可笑至极的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "start_ms": 65400,
      "end_ms": 66780,
      "text": "有一个可笑至极的一个理论"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "start_ms": 66780,
      "end_ms": 70210,
      "text": "说在这个时代绕过马克思"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "start_ms": 70210,
      "end_ms": 72040,
      "text": "绕过马克思去学黑格尔"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "start_ms": 72040,
      "end_ms": 75940,
      "text": "就相当于这个时代不学不学什么"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "start_ms": 77900,
      "end_ms": 83060,
      "text": "绕过朗道去学牛顿"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "start_ms": 85000,
      "end_ms": 87330,
      "text": "这个比喻我觉得可笑至极"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "start_ms": 87330,
      "end_ms": 88140,
      "text": "你明白吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "start_ms": 88140,
      "end_ms": 89850,
      "text": "这是个可笑至极的比喻"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "start_ms": 89850,
      "end_ms": 90960,
      "text": "一方面"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "start_ms": 92360,
      "end_ms": 93220,
      "text": "一方面"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "start_ms": 93220,
      "end_ms": 94690,
      "text": "绝大部分的物理"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "start_ms": 94690,
      "end_ms": 99660,
      "text": "物理学家肯定是先学牛顿经典力学体系"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "start_ms": 100320,
      "end_ms": 101720,
      "text": "在学朗道"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "start_ms": 101720,
      "end_ms": 102620,
      "text": "或者说量子力学"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "start_ms": 102620,
      "end_ms": 104140,
      "text": "普朗克爱因斯坦的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 42,
      "start_ms": 105720,
      "end_ms": 107420,
      "text": "啊你学过物理的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 43,
      "start_ms": 107420,
      "end_ms": 110720,
      "text": "你肯定都知道在学是不是薛定谔在学"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 44,
      "start_ms": 110720,
      "end_ms": 113800,
      "text": "现在就是说是有20亿的德国"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 45,
      "start_ms": 113920,
      "end_ms": 116860,
      "text": "就是说泛德意志地区的物理学发展史的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 46,
      "start_ms": 116860,
      "end_ms": 118770,
      "text": "肯定是先学这个再学这个"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 47,
      "start_ms": 118770,
      "end_ms": 120600,
      "text": "所以如果按照这个比喻的话"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 48,
      "start_ms": 120600,
      "end_ms": 123780,
      "text": "现在的理论家肯定是先学黑格再选马克思"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 49,
      "start_ms": 123800,
      "end_ms": 126470,
      "text": "因为黑格尔的体系是个经典体系"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 50,
      "start_ms": 126470,
      "end_ms": 128479,
      "text": "黑格尔的资产阶级意识形态"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 51,
      "start_ms": 128479,
      "end_ms": 132180,
      "text": "或者说伦理精准性建筑的体系是个经典体系"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 52,
      "start_ms": 133740,
      "end_ms": 138740,
      "text": "另外就是说这方面你们恰恰就如果非要这样说"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 53,
      "start_ms": 138740,
      "end_ms": 141110,
      "text": "那肯定是先选黑客再选马克思"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 54,
      "start_ms": 141110,
      "end_ms": 142460,
      "text": "另外一方面"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 55,
      "start_ms": 142579,
      "end_ms": 144019,
      "text": "朗道和牛顿"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 56,
      "start_ms": 144019,
      "end_ms": 146179,
      "text": "或者我们说现代量子力学"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 57,
      "start_ms": 146179,
      "end_ms": 152780,
      "text": "量子力学和相对论和牛顿力学和牛顿力学啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 58,
      "start_ms": 155439,
      "end_ms": 157500,
      "text": "我们尤其要说的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 59,
      "start_ms": 160239,
      "end_ms": 163859,
      "text": "他们之间的首先当然有革命性"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 60,
      "start_ms": 163859,
      "end_ms": 165500,
      "text": "当然有革命性"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 61,
      "start_ms": 165679,
      "end_ms": 167539,
      "text": "我这个东西欺负你们"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 62,
      "start_ms": 167539,
      "end_ms": 168259,
      "text": "没文化了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 63,
      "start_ms": 168259,
      "end_ms": 170239,
      "text": "你比如说广相广相"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 64,
      "start_ms": 170239,
      "end_ms": 174840,
      "text": "实际上是把牛顿的绝对性推到底了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 65,
      "start_ms": 174840,
      "end_ms": 176460,
      "text": "你知道广广义相对论"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 66,
      "start_ms": 176460,
      "end_ms": 179040,
      "text": "实际上它具有某种绝对主义在里面"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 67,
      "start_ms": 179040,
      "end_ms": 181540,
      "text": "它具有某种绝对主义在里面"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 68,
      "start_ms": 182380,
      "end_ms": 184840,
      "text": "就是说就是"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 69,
      "start_ms": 187899,
      "end_ms": 190079,
      "text": "就是以太反而被拯救了对吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 70,
      "start_ms": 190079,
      "end_ms": 190859,
      "text": "对于广西而言"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 71,
      "start_ms": 190859,
      "end_ms": 192659,
      "text": "以太反而被拯救了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 72,
      "start_ms": 192659,
      "end_ms": 194699,
      "text": "只不过以太不再是以太"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 73,
      "start_ms": 194699,
      "end_ms": 201789,
      "text": "以太是什么都归张亮以太被以太不再作为一个"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 74,
      "start_ms": 201789,
      "end_ms": 203979,
      "text": "就是说你们有没有点文化"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 75,
      "start_ms": 203979,
      "end_ms": 204610,
      "text": "有没有点"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 76,
      "start_ms": 204610,
      "end_ms": 208930,
      "text": "起码就是牛顿力学里面还预设某种刚性拟态"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 77,
      "start_ms": 208930,
      "end_ms": 209650,
      "text": "对不对"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 78,
      "start_ms": 209650,
      "end_ms": 211750,
      "text": "某种刚性拟态只不过是刚性"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 79,
      "start_ms": 211750,
      "end_ms": 212410,
      "text": "再到广场里面"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 80,
      "start_ms": 212410,
      "end_ms": 214020,
      "text": "它不再是刚性的了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 81,
      "start_ms": 215179,
      "end_ms": 220029,
      "text": "它变成了局部空间的几何学性状"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 82,
      "start_ms": 220029,
      "end_ms": 222099,
      "text": "居几何学的displacement"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 83,
      "start_ms": 222099,
      "end_ms": 224019,
      "text": "哎哎哎又哪个词啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 84,
      "start_ms": 224019,
      "end_ms": 225339,
      "text": "我记得不是displaced"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 85,
      "start_ms": 225339,
      "end_ms": 229180,
      "text": "就是几何学的一个配置"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 86,
      "start_ms": 229220,
      "end_ms": 232400,
      "text": "几个人配置它哪个术语我记不得了啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 87,
      "start_ms": 232400,
      "end_ms": 236220,
      "text": "就就metric它是配配置那个质"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 88,
      "start_ms": 236220,
      "end_ms": 240120,
      "text": "就是有位置的那个disposition啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 89,
      "start_ms": 240120,
      "end_ms": 241820,
      "text": "就就是"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 90,
      "start_ms": 243980,
      "end_ms": 250639,
      "text": "刚性以太变成了空间的这个几何学的disposition"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 91,
      "start_ms": 250639,
      "end_ms": 254239,
      "text": "就是他他他一个我们我当时我翻译的这个书"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 92,
      "start_ms": 254239,
      "end_ms": 256399,
      "text": "他妈的还是我翻几个配型吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 93,
      "start_ms": 256399,
      "end_ms": 259039,
      "text": "我们翻译成配型几何学的配型"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 94,
      "start_ms": 259039,
      "end_ms": 261220,
      "text": "几何配型空间的几何配型"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 95,
      "start_ms": 261879,
      "end_ms": 263339,
      "text": "这个空间几何背景"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 96,
      "start_ms": 263339,
      "end_ms": 265979,
      "text": "他其实是就是所有空间都有的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 97,
      "start_ms": 265979,
      "end_ms": 268520,
      "text": "其实它是某种意义上来说啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 98,
      "start_ms": 269220,
      "end_ms": 271580,
      "text": "他是继承了牛顿的魔咒"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 99,
      "start_ms": 271580,
      "end_ms": 273650,
      "text": "义上他继承牛顿明白吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 100,
      "start_ms": 273650,
      "end_ms": 277920,
      "text": "他继承牛顿的思维方式的量子力学同样如此"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 101,
      "start_ms": 278200,
      "end_ms": 281680,
      "text": "量子力学里面的波动力学"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 102,
      "start_ms": 281680,
      "end_ms": 283980,
      "text": "波粒二象性波动力学"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 103,
      "start_ms": 285000,
      "end_ms": 288400,
      "text": "或者说我们什么统计性的统计力学"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 104,
      "start_ms": 288880,
      "end_ms": 290740,
      "text": "就是用统计学模型"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 105,
      "start_ms": 290740,
      "end_ms": 294100,
      "text": "用波动性的模型来代替这个"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 106,
      "start_ms": 294440,
      "end_ms": 298340,
      "text": "这个这个代替那些物理性的那种"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 107,
      "start_ms": 298340,
      "end_ms": 300530,
      "text": "就是一个个小点的那种"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 108,
      "start_ms": 300530,
      "end_ms": 302480,
      "text": "带那种叫什么子的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 109,
      "start_ms": 302480,
      "end_ms": 305760,
      "text": "就是就是那些基本粒子"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 110,
      "start_ms": 305760,
      "end_ms": 309370,
      "text": "用波来重新定义一个基本粒子的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 111,
      "start_ms": 309370,
      "end_ms": 311110,
      "text": "这种这种思维方式"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 112,
      "start_ms": 311110,
      "end_ms": 312310,
      "text": "用关系性"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 113,
      "start_ms": 312310,
      "end_ms": 317540,
      "text": "我们或者说用关系来的代表是来代替实体性啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 114,
      "start_ms": 317540,
      "end_ms": 318830,
      "text": "而代替实体性"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 115,
      "start_ms": 318830,
      "end_ms": 324140,
      "text": "这个是对于牛顿力学的思维方式的继承和发展"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 116,
      "start_ms": 324140,
      "end_ms": 325440,
      "text": "明白了吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 117,
      "start_ms": 327199,
      "end_ms": 329139,
      "text": "就是它是牛顿力学"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 118,
      "start_ms": 329139,
      "end_ms": 331179,
      "text": "他的思维是在去实体化"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 119,
      "start_ms": 331179,
      "end_ms": 334899,
      "text": "用力来把握事物力无非是一种关系"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 120,
      "start_ms": 334899,
      "end_ms": 335680,
      "text": "你知道吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 121,
      "start_ms": 335700,
      "end_ms": 338220,
      "text": "而波动力学只不过进一步的用"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 122,
      "start_ms": 338220,
      "end_ms": 343840,
      "text": "用把这种力的那种与这种那种质"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 123,
      "start_ms": 343840,
      "end_ms": 346120,
      "text": "典型的我们质点这个词中想的质点性的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 124,
      "start_ms": 346120,
      "end_ms": 346600,
      "text": "实际性的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 125,
      "start_ms": 346600,
      "end_ms": 349720,
      "text": "再给它取消掉微观物理当中质点性的东西"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 126,
      "start_ms": 349720,
      "end_ms": 351620,
      "text": "所以你甚至可以看到"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 127,
      "start_ms": 351620,
      "end_ms": 355070,
      "text": "量子力学实际上是牛顿力学的去实体化"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 128,
      "start_ms": 355070,
      "end_ms": 358160,
      "text": "去实体化在微观层面的应用"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 129,
      "start_ms": 358300,
      "end_ms": 359440,
      "text": "明白了吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 130,
      "start_ms": 359440,
      "end_ms": 362290,
      "text": "所以无论是量子力学还是相对论"
    },
    {
